   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "THE PROBLEM\n\n• Central cloud planner → latency\n• Wi-Fi dead zones → robots stall\n• Single point of failure\n• Head-on deadlocks at 1-wide aisles\n• Stop-and-wait wastes fleet time",
   "originalText": "THE PROBLEM\n\n• Central cloud planner → latency\n• Wi-Fi dead zones → robots stall\n• Single point of failure\n• Head-on deadlocks at 1-wide aisles\n• Stop-and-wait wastes fleet time",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "dggl93b10mxh59lw",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
