   "updated": 1726444800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "OUR SOLUTION\n\nEach AMR runs the complete coordination stack on an onboard NVIDIA\nJetson Orin Nano. Robots share position & intent peer-to-peer, bid\nfor tasks in an open auction, plan their own routes and resolve\nconflicts locally in a single 250 ms tick. The dashboard only\nobserves — unplug it and the fleet keeps working.",
   "originalText": "OUR SOLUTION\n\nEach AMR runs the complete coordination stack on an onboard NVIDIA\nJetson Orin Nano. Robots share position & intent peer-to-peer, bid\nfor tasks in an open auction, plan their own routes and resolve\nconflicts locally in a single 250 ms tick. The dashboard only\nobserves — unplug it and the fleet keeps working.",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "7f09ro44n8du3t82",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
