   "text": "DESIGN RULE\n\nAI recommends:\nperception · routing cost · task bids\n\nDeterministic layers decide & veto:\nPIBT · wait-for graph · L2 safety shield\n\n→ no model or network message can bypass\nthe safety shield",
   "originalText": "DESIGN RULE\n\nAI recommends:\nperception · routing cost · task bids\n\nDeterministic layers decide & veto:\nPIBT · wait-for graph · L2 safety shield\n\n→ no model or network message can bypass\nthe safety shield",
