   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• UDP peer-to-peer mesh (Wi-Fi 802.11s)\n• intent · bid · claim · blockage · heartbeat\n• gossip relay (TTL) across dead zones\n• HMAC-signed JSON messages\n• stale peers pruned after 3 s",
   "originalText": "• UDP peer-to-peer mesh (Wi-Fi 802.11s)\n• intent · bid · claim · blockage · heartbeat\n• gossip relay (TTL) across dead zones\n• HMAC-signed JSON messages\n• stale peers pruned after 3 s",
