   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "OUTCOME — measured on our working prototype (seeded simulation + 3 live robot processes over UDP)\n0 inter-robot collisions in every run   ·   51–68 % faster task completion than stop-and-wait (3, 5, 10 AMRs)   ·   head-on conflict 37 → 9 ticks   ·   deadlock\nrecovery 19 → 1 tick   ·   fleet waiting time −98 %",
   "originalText": "OUTCOME — measured on our working prototype (seeded simulation + 3 live robot processes over UDP)\n0 inter-robot collisions in every run   ·   51–68 % faster task completion than stop-and-wait (3, 5, 10 AMRs)   ·   head-on conflict 37 → 9 ticks   ·   deadlock\nrecovery 19 → 1 tick   ·   fleet waiting time −98 %",
